# ============================================================
# BlackSunCyber — .gitignore la radacina solutiei
# ============================================================

# ── Securitate: fisiere cu secrete (NU merg pe GitHub!) ────────────────────
# Cheile Supabase sunt in appsettings.json pe PC Main — nu in repo
BlackSunCyber.Server/appsettings.Production.json

# Token-urile client sunt in agentsettings.json pe fiecare PC — nu in repo
# (StationId e specific fiecarui PC si setat la instalare)
# BlackSunCyber.ClientAgent/agentsettings.json  <- lasa comentat, nu e secret

# ── Build outputs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/

# ── Visual Studio ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.rsuser
*.userosscache

# ── Fisiere generate automat de Watcher pe PC Main (nu in sursa) ───────────
BlackSunCyber.Server/wwwroot/downloads/client.zip
BlackSunCyber.Server/wwwroot/downloads/*.zip

# ── Log-uri ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
updater.log
*.log
*.[Ll]ogs/

# ── NuGet ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/

# ── Altele ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
